     8797                              import stream Instream buf-userconf.ARM                                 buf-userconf.max-discnt                                 buf-userconf.obj-code                                 buf-userconf.obj-type                                 buf-userconf.on-line                                 buf-userconf.user-name                                 buf-userconf.arm-host-code                                 buf-userconf.userid_                                 buf-userconf.user-name_                                 buf-userconf.password_ no-error.
     8798                              if error-status:error then do:
